#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Versi pakej\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kod di halaman ini dibangunkan menggunakan keperluan berikut.\n"
"Kami syorkan menggunakan versi ini atau yang lebih baru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"While the [timeline drawer](/guides/visualize-circuit-timing) built in to Qiskit is useful for static circuits, it might not accurately reflect the timing of [dynamic circuits](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) because of implicit operations such as broadcasting and branch determination. As part of dynamic circuit support, Qiskit Runtime returns the accurate circuit timing information inside the job results when requested.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Walaupun [pelukis garis masa](/guides/visualize-circuit-timing) yang terbina dalam Qiskit berguna untuk Circuit statik, ia mungkin tidak mencerminkan pemasaan [Circuit dinamik](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) dengan tepat kerana operasi implisit seperti penyiaran dan penentuan cabang. Sebagai sebahagian daripada sokongan Circuit dinamik, Qiskit Runtime mengembalikan maklumat pemasaan Circuit yang tepat di dalam keputusan kerja apabila diminta.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"- This is an experimental function. It is in preview release status and is therefore subject to change.\n"
"- This function only applies to Qiskit Runtime Sampler jobs.\n"
"- Although the total circuit time is returned in the \"compilation\" metadata, this is NOT the time used for billing (QPU time).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Nota\">\n"
"- Ini adalah fungsi eksperimen. Ia berada dalam status keluaran pratonton dan oleh itu tertakluk kepada perubahan.\n"
"- Fungsi ini hanya terpakai pada kerja Sampler Qiskit Runtime.\n"
"- Walaupun jumlah masa Circuit dikembalikan dalam metadata \"compilation\", ini BUKAN masa yang digunakan untuk pengebilan (masa QPU).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Enable timing data retrieval {#enable-timing-data-retrieval}"
msgstr "Aktifkan pengambilan data pemasaan {#enable-timing-data-retrieval}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To enable timing data retrieval, set the experimental `scheduler_timing` "
"flag to `True` when running the primitive job.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengaktifkan pengambilan data pemasaan, tetapkan bendera eksperimen "
"`scheduler_timing` kepada `True` apabila menjalankan kerja primitif.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Access the circuit timing data {#access-the-circuit-timing-data}"
msgstr "Akses data pemasaan Circuit {#access-the-circuit-timing-data}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When requested, the circuit timing data for each PUB is returned in the job "
"result metadata, under "
"`[\"compilation\"][\"scheduler_timing\"][\"timing\"]`. This field contains "
"the raw timing information. To display the timing information, use the "
"built-in visualization tool, as described in the [Visualize the "
"timings](#visualize-timings) section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Apabila diminta, data pemasaan Circuit untuk setiap PUB dikembalikan dalam "
"metadata keputusan kerja, di bawah "
"`[\"compilation\"][\"scheduler_timing\"][\"timing\"]`. Medan ini mengandungi"
" maklumat pemasaan mentah. Untuk memaparkan maklumat pemasaan, gunakan alat "
"visualisasi terbina dalam, seperti yang diterangkan dalam bahagian "
"[Visualisasi pemasaan](#visualize-timings).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the following code to access the circuit timing data for the first "
"PUB:\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan kod berikut untuk mengakses data pemasaan Circuit bagi PUB "
"pertama:\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Understand the raw timing data {#understand-the-raw-timing-data}"
msgstr "Fahami data pemasaan mentah {#understand-the-raw-timing-data}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"While visualizing the circuit timing data by using the "
"`draw_circuit_schedule_timing` method is the most common use case, it might "
"be useful to understand the structure of the raw timing data returned. This "
"could help you, for example, to extract information programmatically.\n"
msgstr ""
"Walaupun memvisualisasi data pemasaan Circuit menggunakan kaedah "
"`draw_circuit_schedule_timing` adalah kes penggunaan paling biasa, mungkin "
"berguna untuk memahami struktur data pemasaan mentah yang dikembalikan. Ini "
"boleh membantu anda, misalnya, untuk mengekstrak maklumat secara aturcara.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The timing data returned in "
"`[\"compilation\"][\"scheduler_timing\"][\"timing\"]` is a list of strings. "
"Each string represents a single instruction on some channel and is comma-"
"separated into the following data types:\n"
msgstr ""
"Data pemasaan yang dikembalikan dalam "
"`[\"compilation\"][\"scheduler_timing\"][\"timing\"]` adalah senarai "
"rentetan. Setiap rentetan mewakili satu arahan pada saluran tertentu dan "
"dipisahkan koma kepada jenis data berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Branch` - Determines whether the instruction is in a control flow (then / "
"else) or a main branch.\n"
msgstr ""
"`Branch` - Menentukan sama ada arahan berada dalam aliran kawalan (then / "
"else) atau cabang utama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`Instruction` - The gate and the qubit to operate on.\n"
msgstr "`Instruction` - Gate dan qubit yang perlu dioperasikan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Channel` - The channel that is being assigned with the instruction. It can "
"be one of the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"`Channel` - Saluran yang ditetapkan dengan arahan. Ia boleh menjadi salah "
"satu daripada berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`Qubit x` - The drive channel for qubit _x_.\n"
msgstr "`qubit x` - Saluran pemacu untuk qubit _x_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`AWGRx_y` (arbitrary waveform generator readout) - Used by readout channels "
"to communicate when measuring qubits. The _x_ and _y_ arguments correspond "
"to the readout instrument ID and the qubit number, respectively.\n"
msgstr ""
"`AWGRx_y` (penjana gelombang sewenang-wenang readout) - Digunakan oleh "
"saluran readout untuk berkomunikasi apabila mengukur qubit. Argumen _x_ dan "
"_y_ sepadan dengan ID instrumen readout dan nombor qubit, masing-masing.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`T0` - The instruction start time within the complete schedule\n"
msgstr "`T0` - Masa mula arahan dalam jadual lengkap\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Duration` - The instruction's duration, in units of _dt_ seconds,  where 1 "
"dt = 1 scheduling cycle. You can find the `dt` value of a backend by using "
"[`backend.dt`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2#dt).\n"
msgstr ""
"`Duration` - Tempoh arahan, dalam unit _dt_ saat, di mana 1 dt = 1 kitaran "
"penjadualan. Anda boleh mencari nilai `dt` bagi Backend menggunakan "
"[`backend.dt`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2#dt).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`Pulse` - The type of pulse operation being used.\n"
msgstr "`Pulse` - Jenis operasi nadi yang digunakan.\n"

